post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'

Tabula Sonora needs a copy of SCCore.dll from a licensed Roland SOUND Canvas VA
1.1.6 installation. It is not distributed with this package and cannot be: it is
Roland's, and it holds the 24 MB wave ROM the synthesizer voice is built from.

The file is read as data and never loaded as code. The application asks for it on
first launch and keeps its own verified copy under ~/.local/share/tabula-sonora/.

The build it accepts is exactly 27,347,456 bytes,
SHA-256 117e6aa147a96fbde5e10d2caf16c89965acc1e44235fd245992216cc620bdb1.
Any other build has its tables at different offsets and is refused.

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    :
}
